            'the-witcher-3-wild-hunt' => ['long_description' => "The Witcher 3 follows Geralt of Rivia, a professional monster hunter searching for Ciri, a young woman pursued by the otherworldly Wild Hunt. The trail crosses war-torn regions, remote villages, and crowded cities, with local stories that often carry consequences beyond a single contract.\n\nCombat combines swordplay, alchemy, and magical Signs. Investigation matters: Geralt reads tracks and gathers clues before confronting a monster, while conversations and choices can alter the fate of people and places. The main journey is joined by optional contracts and character-led quests.", 'metadata' => ['developer' => 'CD PROJEKT RED', 'publisher' => 'CD PROJEKT RED']],
            'red-dead-redemption-2' => ['long_description' => "Set in 1899, Red Dead Redemption 2 follows Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde gang as their old way of life is squeezed by lawmen, rival groups, and a changing country. The story moves through towns, wilderness, and camps where the gang’s relationships develop over time.\n\nOutside the main story, the frontier supports hunting, fishing, exploration, and encounters with strangers. Arthur’s interactions and choices shape how some moments play out, while the world’s routines and changing conditions make travel itself part of the experience.", 'metadata' => ['developer' => 'Rockstar Studios', 'publisher' => 'Rockstar Games']],
            'elden-ring' => ['long_description' => "Elden Ring takes place in the Lands Between, a broad fantasy realm shaped by the shattered Elden Ring and the demigods who hold its fragments. As a Tarnished, you explore its roads, ruins, caves, and castles while pursuing the title of Elden Lord.\n\nThe world is designed for discovery: routes can branch, landmarks hide optional challenges, and encounters often reward observation as much as combat. Character growth supports many approaches, from close-range weapons to ranged attacks and magic, while its demanding boss fights test timing and preparation.", 'metadata' => ['developer' => 'FromSoftware', 'publisher' => 'Bandai Namco Entertainment']],
            'baldurs-gate-3' => [
                'long_description' => "Baldur’s Gate 3 is a party-based role-playing adventure set in the Forgotten Realms. After a mind flayer parasite is implanted in your character, the search for a cure draws you into a conflict involving companions, rival powers, and the fate of the region. You can create a character or begin with one of the Origin heroes, each with a distinct background.\n\nExploration and dialogue use the same freedom as combat: choices can open, close, or reshape paths through the story. Turn-based encounters are built around positioning, abilities, and the Dungeons & Dragons ruleset. You can play alone or take the adventure online with a party of up to four.",
